      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "I — The Problem",
      "estimated_duration_s": 21,
      "narration_text": "Here's the problem. Hundreds of new AI papers land on arXiv every week. Keyword search misses the paper that says the same thing in different words. A general chatbot may not know last month's work, and may not tell you. And reading everything yourself stopped being possible a long time ago.",
