    {
      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "I — The Problem",
      "estimated_duration_s": 23,
      "narration_text": "The fix has a name: retrieval-augmented generation, or RAG. Before the model answers, you search your own collection, pull out the most relevant passages, and hand those to the model along with the question. It writes from what it was given, and it can point to where each part came from. The search does the heavy lifting.",
      "new_visual_element": "RAG as a five-step chain",
