      "beat_id": "B05",
      "act": "II — The Map",
      "estimated_duration_s": 28,
      "narration_text": "Here's what stage one actually built. The API. A Postgres database holding one sample paper. The local model runtime, with a small model pulled. The search engine, empty for now. And the pipeline scheduler, running a test job. All five are wired together and health-checked, and the API's health check asks the database, the model and search by name. And the ask endpoint? It returns a fake answer. On purpose.",
