      "act": "III — The Order",
      "estimated_duration_s": 24,
      "narration_text": "Inside the API, the order came from what depends on what. Config first: one settings class that reads every value from one file. Then the database connection. Then what a paper is. Then every query, in one place. And last, the web routes. Each layer only uses the ones before it, so each can be tested before the next one exists.",
