      "act": "III — The Order",
      "estimated_duration_s": 26,
      "narration_text": "Then the services, one at a time: the database, then the model runtime, then search, then the scheduler. Each got its own commit, and every commit left the whole system running. That pays off the moment something breaks. When the health check stopped listing search at all, there was only one suspect: the step I'd just added. The container was still running old code.",
